# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored, on purpose. Do not add these — each one breaks the build:
#
# src/prisma/          Prisma 8 contract mode ships contract.json +
#                      contract.d.ts as committed source, and src/prisma/db.ts
#                      imports contract.json at module load. Excluding the
#                      directory yields a build that COMPILES and then throws
#                      at runtime.
# pnpm-lock.yaml       the frozen install must match it.
# pnpm-workspace.yaml  carries the `allowBuilds` allowlist (esbuild,
#                      msgpackr-extract, workerd).
# .npmrc               carries the matching `onlyBuiltDependencies`.
#
# Dropping either of the last two makes native deps silently unbuildable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
